  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Arcforge Players Compendium</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Divination sphere, Tinker sphere (Sensory Set).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may target any of your sensory gizmos with your Divination sphere (divine) and (sense) talents as if they were yourself. The sensory gizmos and any recordings they make benefit from any (divine) and (sense) talents active on them at the time of recording. Targeting a gizmo with a (divine) or (sense) costs 1 additional spell point.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gizmo-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
